---
description: Independent reviewer for the quality gates of the keel workflow (minimal AIDLC). Checks requirements, units of work or code against given criteria and returns a review. Never changes files.
mode: subagent
temperature: 0.1
permission:
  edit: deny
  webfetch: deny
  bash:
    "*": ask
    "git status*": allow
    "git diff*": allow
    "git log*": allow
---

